:''For the unique enemy introduced in these stages, see [[Wicked Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Wicked Cat''' (ネコの解放, ''Neko no Kaihō'', '''Unleashing the Cat''') is one of the [[Empress' Research]] maps, appearing only after [[Arcane Confluence]] has been cleared in full. Upon completion, 50 [[Cat Food]] will be received as a [[Catnip Challenges|mission]] reward. It is one of the three maps that are required to unlock [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]], the others being [[Wicked Tank]] and [[Wicked Axe]]. This event was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

